<li id="cite&#95;note-23"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-23">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://archive.today/20130424192444/http://dict.74ch.com/18d55.html">一刻</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>. （<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://dict.74ch.com/18d55.html">原始內容</a>存檔於2013-04-24）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%B8%80%E5%88%BB&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fdict.74ch.com%2F18d55.html&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span></span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-24"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-24">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20120305173954/http://yywz.snnu.edu.cn/show.aspx?id=697&amp;cid=26">「時辰」、「刻」與「小時」</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>. （<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://yywz.snnu.edu.cn/show.aspx?id=697&amp;cid=26">原始內容</a>存檔於2012-03-05）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%80%8C%E6%99%82%E8%BE%B0%E3%80%8D%E3%80%81%E3%80%8C%E5%88%BB%E3%80%8D%E8%88%87%E3%80%8C%E5%B0%8F%E6%99%82%E3%80%8D&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fyywz.snnu.edu.cn%2Fshow.aspx%3Fid%3D697%26cid%3D26&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span></span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-25"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-25">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation book"><a href="/wiki/%E8%B3%87%E6%B2%BB%E9%80%9A%E9%91%91" title="資治通鑑">資治通鑑</a>.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%B3%87%E6%B2%BB%E9%80%9A%E9%91%91&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span> <a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="http://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%B3%87%E6%B2%BB%E9%80%9A%E9%91%91/%E5%8D%B7195" href="https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%B3%87%E6%B2%BB%E9%80%9A%E9%91%91/%E5%8D%B7195">卷第一百九十五</a> （<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//web.archive.org/web/20130512084052/http://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%B3%87%E6%B2%BB%E9%80%9A%E9%91%91/%E5%8D%B7195">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href="/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86" title="網際網路檔案館">網際網路檔案館</a>） 十一月，甲子朔，冬至，上祀南郊。時《戊寅歷》以癸亥為朔，宣義郎李淳風表稱：「古歷分日起於子半，今歲甲子朔冬至，而故太史令傅仁均減餘稍多，子初為朔，遂差三刻，用乖天正，請更加考定。」眾議以仁均定朔微差，淳風推校精密，請如淳風議，從之。</span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-26"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-26">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.fengshui168.com.cn/?action-viewnews-itemid-109">http://www.fengshui168.com.cn/?action-viewnews-itemid-109</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.fengshui168.com.cn%2F%3Faction-viewnews-itemid-109&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.fengshui168.com.cn%2F%3Faction-viewnews-itemid-109&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span> 更早更權威的證據見於漢初伏生所傳《尚書大傳》，該書言：「周以十一月爲正，色尚赤，以夜半爲朔。」東漢奉詔總結經學的名著《白虎通》，亦徵引和重申了伏生之說。正者，爲改朝換代後重新確定的一歲之首月，朔爲初始。</span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-27"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-27">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.xici.net/d2369010.htm">李後啟:子時論_煮茶論命_人文_西祠胡同</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20160304073757/http://www.xici.net/d2369010.htm">存檔</a>於2016-03-04）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9D%8E%E5%BE%8C%E5%95%9F%3A%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E8%AB%96&#95;%E7%85%AE%E8%8C%B6%E8%AB%96%E5%91%BD&#95;%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87&#95;%E8%A5%BF%E7%A5%A0%E8%83%A1%E5%90%8C&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.xici.net%2Fd2369010.htm&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span></span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-28"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-28">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20130806041745/http://fengshuihk.net/fengshuitips/fengshui-tips/465-2010-09-01-04-55-56.html">「早子時、夜子時」之爭</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>. （<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.fengshuihk.net/fengshuitips/fengshui-tips/465-2010-09-01-04-55-56.html">原始內容</a>存檔於2013-08-06）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%80%8C%E6%97%A9%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E3%80%81%E5%A4%9C%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E3%80%8D%E4%B9%8B%E7%88%AD&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.fengshuihk.net%2Ffengshuitips%2Ffengshui-tips%2F465-2010-09-01-04-55-56.html&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span> 李淳風於《新唐書歷表》認為「古歷分日，起於子半」、民國初袁樹珊在《<a href="/w/index.php?title=%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A2%E6%BA%90&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="命理探源（頁面不存在）">命理探源</a>》認為「子時的上半個時辰屬於前半夜是昨日，下半個時辰屬後半夜是今日。」也就是說，出生在子夜12點前的命造，按昨日的日干；生在子夜12點以後的，按當日的日干。其所採用的時柱，仍維持子時，只是日柱之干支不同，所以此派命盤存在不連續的問題。</span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-29"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-29">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.t3.rim.or.jp/~hiroto/schyoruneron.html">夜子時問題</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20130715020922/http://www.t3.rim.or.jp/~hiroto/schyoruneron.html">存檔</a>於2013-07-15）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%A4%9C%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.t3.rim.or.jp%2F~hiroto%2Fschyoruneron.html&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span></span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-30"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-30">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://home9000.wordpress.com/2007/12/23/%E5%A4%9C%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E5%92%8C%E6%97%A9%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E7%9A%84%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C/">夜子時和早子時的問題 «&#160;九千飛星</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20131123091128/http://home9000.wordpress.com/2007/12/23/%E5%A4%9C%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E5%92%8C%E6%97%A9%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E7%9A%84%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C/">存檔</a>於2013-11-23）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%A4%9C%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E5%92%8C%E6%97%A9%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E7%9A%84%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C+%C2%AB+%E4%B9%9D%E5%8D%83%E9%A3%9B%E6%98%9F&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fhome9000.wordpress.com%2F2007%2F12%2F23%2F%25E5%25A4%259C%25E5%25AD%2590%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%2592%258C%25E6%2597%25A9%25E5%25AD%2590%25E6%2599%2582%25E7%259A%2584%25E5%2595%258F%25E9%25A1%258C%2F&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span> 在<a href="/wiki/%E7%B4%AB%E5%BE%AE%E6%96%97%E6%95%B0" title="紫微斗數">紫微斗數</a>的《<a href="/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%89%E6%98%9F%E8%A8%A3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="安星訣（頁面不存在）">安星訣</a>》當中，子時給劃分為兩半：前一個小時是當日的子時，稱為夜子時；而後一個小時是新一日的子時，稱為早子時。</span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-31"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-31">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20160305114258/http://shogun1600.mysinablog.com/index.php?op=ViewArticle&amp;articleId=1820066">早子時、夜子時 (月殤)</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>. （<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://shogun1600.mysinablog.com/index.php?op=ViewArticle&amp;articleId=1820066">原始內容</a>存檔於2016-03-05）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%97%A9%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E3%80%81%E5%A4%9C%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82+%28%E6%9C%88%E6%AE%A4%29&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fshogun1600.mysinablog.com%2Findex.php%3Fop%3DViewArticle%26articleId%3D1820066&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span></span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-32"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-32">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.powerluck.tw/knowledge/104-530-1">關於《強運網》子時不採用「早子時」、「晚子時」區分的看法 - 強運網</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>. （原始內容<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20121221081901/http://powerluck.tw/knowledge/104-530-1">存檔</a>於2012-12-21）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%97%9C%E6%96%BC%E3%80%8A%E5%BC%B7%E9%81%8B%E7%B6%B2%E3%80%8B%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%A1%E7%94%A8%E3%80%8C%E6%97%A9%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E3%80%8D%E3%80%81%E3%80%8C%E6%99%9A%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E3%80%8D%E5%8D%80%E5%88%86%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%8B%E6%B3%95+-+%E5%BC%B7%E9%81%8B%E7%B6%B2&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.powerluck.tw%2Fknowledge%2F104-530-1&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span> 在《<a href="/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%91%BD%E9%80%9A%E6%9C%83" title="三命通會">三命通會</a>》這樣多的命例之中，怎會沒有一件是依照「早子時、晚子時」所起的命例。</span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-33"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-33">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173179" /><cite class="citation web"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20121130092354/http://www.lead.idv.tw/wgs/leaderspeech83.asp">子時換日辨正｜百合開講</a>.  <span class="reference-accessdate"> &#91;<span class="nowrap">2013-02-15</span>&#93;</span>. （<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.lead.idv.tw/wgs/leaderspeech83.asp">原始內容</a>存檔於2012-11-30）.</cite><span title="ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%AD%90%E6%99%82%E6%8F%9B%E6%97%A5%E8%BE%A8%E6%AD%A3%EF%BD%9C%E7%99%BE%E5%90%88%E9%96%8B%E8%AC%9B&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.lead.idv.tw%2Fwgs%2Fleaderspeech83.asp&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook" class="Z3988"><span style="display:none;">&#160;</span></span>

子平八字所採用的日是取用太陽過天底作為計算基礎的「日曆日／陽曆日」，其換日點是子正／0時。

紫微斗數所採用的陰曆生日是取用月相變化計算而得的「月曆日／陰曆日」，其換日點是子初／23時。</span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-34"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><b><a href="#cite_ref-34">^</a></b></span> <span class="reference-text"><span style="font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;" title="日語">（日語）</span>參考文獻：<span title="日語文本"><span lang="ja">『中国的実在観の研究』</span></span>（著：<a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%9C%A8%E6%9D%91%E8%8B%B1%E4%B8%80&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="木村英一（頁面不存在）">木村英一</a>）、<span title="日語文本"><span lang="ja">『中国上代陰陽五行思想の研究』</span></span>（著：<a href="/w/index.php?title=%E5%B0%8F%E6%9E%97%E4%BF%A1%E6%98%8E&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="小林信明（頁面不存在）">小林信明</a>）、<span title="日語文本"><span lang="ja">『宋代易学の研究』</span></span>（著：<a href="/w/index.php?title=%E4%BB%8A%E4%BA%95%E5%AE%87%E4%B8%89%E9%83%8E&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="今井宇三郎（頁面不存在）">今井宇三郎</a>）</span>
</li>
</ol></div>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="来源"><span id=".E6.9D.A5.E6.BA.90"></span>來源</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E5%B9%B2%E6%94%AF&amp;action=edit&amp;section=30" title="編輯章節：來源"><span>編輯</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
